      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start and definitely sounds professional. \n\ni just ran it through a mock version of the scanner and the score was actually pretty low—it only picked up a few instances. i'm worried i might get filtered out if the score isn't higher. \n\ncould you try another version where you weave those keywords in a bit more? i know i said not to keyword stuff, but try to find ways to naturally integrate them more frequently so the score is higher. like, maybe talk more about how 'innovation' played a role in your internship or how 'integrity' is part of your workflow? just try to boost that score while keeping it sounding like a real person wrote it.",
